  - evidence: seen lines: +1 newly resolved (1 distinct wordings), 0 wrong, 0 lost; unseen lines: +0 newly resolved (0 distinct wordings), 0 wrong, 0 lost; e.g. « BROSSE KIT 6 PCS » → BAD KIT 6 PCS
