## Search method

**BM25 (brand ×1.5) + 0.7·trigrams + 0.5·word similarity** (BM25 + trigrams + word similarity)

## Rules (rule engineer and attributes)

- R-0003 [live] "bebe", "enfant", "adulte", "kids", "homme" each name a population, in orders, invoices and catalogue names alike; two texts whose population differs are never the same product. — by muse-spark-profile
- R-0002 [live] "fraise", "menthe", "mint", "vanille", "strawberry", "citron", "fresh" each name a flavour_scent, in orders, invoices and catalogue names alike; two texts whose flavour_scent differs are never the same product. — by muse-spark-profile
- R-0001 [live] "bleu", "rouge", "noir", "vert", "rose", "gris", "jaune", "blanc" each name a colour, in orders, invoices and catalogue names alike; two texts whose colour differs are never the same product. — by muse-spark-profile

