## Calibrations

- **calibration after 30 invoices** (396 seen + 132 unseen lines): 306/396 right with no AI (77 %), 1 wrong → 317/396 right with no AI (80 %), 1 wrong; accepted 5, rejected 28; search: BM25 (brand ×2) + 0.5·trigrams: right product in the top 8 for 96.2 % of lines (MRR 0.94) → BM25 (brand ×1.5) + trigrams: 95.5 % in the top 8 (MRR 0.94); engineer rules []; $0.2230. Spark: catalogue abbreviates function and suppliers glue counts and space units differently plus B20/B30 bare packs miss x tokens
- **calibration after 60 invoices** (777 seen + 260 unseen lines): 617/777 right with no AI (79 %), 1 wrong → 629/777 right with no AI (81 %), 1 wrong; accepted 3, rejected 9; search: BM25 (brand ×1.5) + trigrams: right product in the top 8 for 96.7 % of lines (MRR 0.95) → BM25 (brand ×1.5) + 0.7·trigrams + 0.5·word similarity: 97.2 % in the top 8 (MRR 0.96); engineer rules []; $0.1610. Spark: pharmacy abbreviations crem/shp/br/brosse/gttes/sach and bare B20/B30/B50 packs plus AD->ADULTE block auto-match, rest left to shortlist for precision
- **calibration after 90 invoices** (1189 seen + 397 unseen lines): 970/1189 right with no AI (82 %), 5 wrong → 984/1189 right with no AI (83 %), 5 wrong; accepted 3, rejected 7; search: BM25 (brand ×1.5) + 0.7·trigrams + 0.5·word similarity: right product in the top 8 for 97.2 % of lines (MRR 0.95) → BM25 (brand ×1.5) + 0.7·trigrams + 0.5·word similarity: 97.2 % in the top 8 (MRR 0.95); engineer rules []; $0.1879. Spark: abbreviations SHP/BR/B without slash, French spellings, and extra generic words spray/creme/anti/fl/lp block exact match; split_glued and shade normalize glued packs and N-numbers.
- **calibration after 120 invoices** (1601 seen + 534 unseen lines): 1335/1601 right with no AI (83 %), 5 wrong → 1341/1601 right with no AI (84 %), 5 wrong; accepted 1, rejected 9; search: BM25 (brand ×1.5) + 0.7·trigrams + 0.5·word similarity: right product in the top 8 for 97.0 % of lines (MRR 0.95) → BM25 (brand ×1.5) + 0.7·trigrams + 0.5·word similarity: 97.0 % in the top 8 (MRR 0.95); engineer rules []; $0.2107. Spark: slash-less B packs, SHAMP/CREME/COMPRIME abbreviations, singular-plural and FR spelling variants block exact match and search rank

